/E (The Frank Anthony Public School campus came alive with bright yellow and red colors on November 1, 2026, as students and teachers gathered with immense pride to celebrate the 69th Kannada Rajyotsava. The morning event commenced with a warm welcome address by the Head Boy Hisham, setting a joyful tone for the entire school community. This was followed by the traditional lighting of the lamp by the school heads while a serene Kannada song played, after which the leadership team was honored for their constant support and guidance. Mrs. Briggs then led everyone in a peaceful prayer, preparing the audience for the patriotic events to follow.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
